    "ingredients": {
      "type": "zeta-ingredients",
      "blocks": {
        "i1": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"30,3 55,17 55,43 30,57 5,43 5,17\" stroke=\"#006E73\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Georgia,serif\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#006E73\" font-style=\"italic\">R</text></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "",
            "label": "The Sirtuin Switch",
            "label_color": "teal",
            "name": "Resveratrol",
            "source": "from Polygonum cuspidatum · 75 mg per capsule",
            "body": "<p>The famous one. The \"Mediterranean diet\" molecule that scientists have been studying since the '90s. Activates sirtuins — the proteins your cells use to defend and repair themselves. The science isn't hype; it's just slow, the way real longevity science tends to be.</p>",
            "nick": ""
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><polygon points=\"30,3 57,30 30,57 3,30\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/><polygon points=\"30,15 45,30 30,45 15,30\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"3\" fill=\"#B89968\"/></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "",
            "label": "The Senolytic",
            "label_color": "bronze",
            "name": "Quercetin",
            "source": "from Sophora japonica bud · 250 mg per capsule",
            "body": "<p>The senolytic. One of the ways cells age badly is by accumulating <strong>senescent cells</strong> — cells that have stopped functioning but refuse to die, lingering in tissue and generating chronic low-grade inflammation. Scientists sometimes call them zombie cells: not quite alive, not quite gone, and actively dragging down the healthy cells around them. Quercetin is one of the best-studied compounds for clearing them out. It also synergizes with the other two, which is why stacking matters.</p>",
            "nick": ""
          }
        },
        "i3": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M6,30 Q30,8 54,30 Q30,52 6,30 Z\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"8\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" fill=\"none\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#6B7280\"/></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "The Differentiator",
            "label": "The Methylated Upgrade",
            "label_color": "mid",
            "name": "Pterostilbene",
            "source": "PteroPure® (ChromaDex) · 62.5 mg per capsule",
            "body": "<p>Methylated resveratrol. The methyl groups cap resveratrol's free hydroxyl sites — the result is dramatically higher hepatic stability, better intestinal absorption, and a longer half-life in circulation. Your body gets more of it, and it stays longer. We use PteroPure® — the branded, pharmaceutical-grade form from ChromaDex, the same company behind NR research.</p>",
            "nick": ""
          }
        }
      },
